    "detailed_description": "This game is a hero defense game, when you level up through the experience gained by killing monsters.<br />\r\nYou can summon and upgrade randomly given heroes<br />\r\n<br />\r\nItems can be obtained with a certain probability when defeating monsters, and can be equipped to the appropriate hero.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf a hero is killed by a monster, it can be resurrected after 45 seconds, and if the hero dies a total of 20 times, the hero will be defeated, so make sure that the hero does not die.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt consists of a total of 11 stages and can be cleared by defending 60 rounds of each stage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA mighty army of 20 people!<br />\r\nYou must train them to create a stronger army and defeat the final boss Demon.",
